  "_comment": "Consolidated exclude list for SSL pretraining. Three groups of patterns combined: (1) treatment-group prefixes the user wants excluded outright; (2) individual files flagged as noisy/blurry by the QC pass (flagged_sources.json); (3) anything still present in the live configs' exclude_patterns that is not already covered by groups 1 or 2. PatchDataset matches each pattern as a case-insensitive substring against the source filename; any record whose name contains ANY of these strings is dropped before train/val split.",
  "_source_files": [
    "data/data_analysis/exclude_patterns_safe.json",
    "data/data_analysis/flagged_sources.json",
    "configs/pretrain_*/[0-9]*.json::data.exclude_patterns"
  ],
